<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>PresyoCheck | Community Price Monitor</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    body {
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: #f5f7f6;
        color: #202624;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* HEADER */
    header {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e6e4;
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 10;
    }

    .nav {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 18px 24px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .logo {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #176b4d;
    }

    .logo span {
        color: #222;
    }

    .nav-text {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #66706c;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 45px auto 30px;
        padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .hero-label {
        color: #176b4d;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 54px);
        line-height: 1.05;
        max-width: 750px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
        max-width: 650px;
        color: #66706c;
        font-size: 16px;
    }

    /* UPDATE BAR */
    .update-bar {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto 30px;
        padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .update {
        background: #e8f3ee;
        border: 1px solid #cfe4da;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #315a49;
    }

    /* MAIN */
    main {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 0 24px 60px;
    }

    .section-title {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: end;
        margin: 35px 0 15px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
        font-size: 24px;
    }

    .section-title p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #737b78;
    }

    /* PRICE CARDS */
    .price-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .price-card {
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid #e1e5e3;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 18px;
        transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .price-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }

    .category {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #7a817e;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .product {
        font-size: 16px;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .price {
        font-size: 25px;
        font-weight: 800;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .unit {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #858c89;
        font-weight: normal;
    }

    .change {
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .up {
        color: #b34b3f;
    }

    .down {
        color: #267b58;
    }

    .same {
        color: #747b78;
    }

    /* ARTICLES */
    .articles {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
        gap: 15px;
    }

    .article {
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid #e1e5e3;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 22px;
    }

    .article:first-child {
        min-height: 240px;
    }

    .article-label {
        color: #176b4d;
        font-size: 11px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: .8px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .article h3 {
        font-size: 21px;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .article p {
        color: #626a66;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .read {
        display: inline-block;
        color: #176b4d;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .read:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* INFO */
    .info {
        margin-top: 35px;
        padding: 25px;
        background: #202624;
        color: white;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .info h2 {
        font-size: 21px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .info p {
        color: #cbd2cf;
        font-size: 13px;
        max-width: 800px;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
        border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
        background: white;
        padding: 25px;
        text-align: center;
        color: #7b827f;
        font-size: 12px;
    }

    /* MOBILE */
    @media (max-width: 800px) {
        .price-grid {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }

        .articles {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 500px) {
        .nav {
            padding: 15px 18px;
        }

        .hero,
        .update-bar,
        main {
            padding-left: 18px;
            padding-right: 18px;
        }

        .hero {
            margin-top: 35px;
        }

        .price-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .price-card {
            padding: 14px;
        }

        .price {
            font-size: 21px;
        }

        .nav-text {
            display: none;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="nav">
        <div class="logo">
            Presyo<span>Check</span>
        </div>

        <div class="nav-text">
            Community Price Information
        </div>
    </div>
</header>


<section class="hero">

    <div class="hero-label">
        Price monitoring
    </div>

    <h1>
        Know the price before you shop.
    </h1>

    <p>
        PresyoCheck provides accessible information on selected
        prices of basic commodities and fuel to help consumers
        plan their household budget.
    </p>

</section>


<div class="update-bar">

    <div class="update">
        <strong>Last updated:</strong>
        September 21, 2026 &nbsp; • &nbsp;
        Prices may vary depending on location and seller.
    </div>

</div>


<main>

    <div class="section-title">

        <div>
            <h2>Today's Price Update</h2>
            <p>Selected basic commodities and fuel</p>
        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="price-grid">

        <!-- RICE -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Basic Commodity</div>

            <div class="product">
                Regular-Milled Rice
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱48.00
                <span class="unit">/ kg</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change up">
                ↑ Increased
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- EGGS -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Basic Commodity</div>

            <div class="product">
                Chicken Eggs
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱9.50
                <span class="unit">/ piece</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change same">
                → No change
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- OIL -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Basic Commodity</div>

            <div class="product">
                Cooking Oil
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱85.00
                <span class="unit">/ liter</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change down">
                ↓ Decreased
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- CHICKEN -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Basic Commodity</div>

            <div class="product">
                Whole Chicken
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱205.00
                <span class="unit">/ kg</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change up">
                ↑ Increased
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- GASOLINE -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Fuel</div>

            <div class="product">
                Gasoline
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱64.00
                <span class="unit">/ liter</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change up">
                ↑ Increased
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- DIESEL -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Fuel</div>

            <div class="product">
                Diesel
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱55.00
                <span class="unit">/ liter</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change down">
                ↓ Decreased
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- LPG -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Household</div>

            <div class="product">
                LPG
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱820.00
                <span class="unit">/ 11 kg</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change same">
                → No change
            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- SUGAR -->
        <div class="price-card">

            <div class="category">Basic Commodity</div>

            <div class="product">
                Refined Sugar
            </div>

            <div class="price">
                ₱78.00
                <span class="unit">/ kg</span>
            </div>

            <div class="change up">
                ↑ Increased
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>


    <!-- ARTICLES -->

    <div class="section-title">

        <div>
            <h2>Price Watch</h2>
            <p>Recent information about prices and household budgeting</p>
        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="articles">


        <article class="article">

            <div class="article-label">
                Price Watch
            </div>

            <h3>
                What rising fuel prices can mean for household expenses
            </h3>

            <p>
                Changes in fuel prices can affect transportation,
                delivery costs, and the prices of other goods.
                Understanding these changes can help consumers
                plan their spending.
            </p>

            <a href="#article1" class="read">
                Read article →
            </a>

        </article>


        <article class="article">

            <div class="article-label">
                Budgeting
            </div>

            <h3>
                Checking prices before going to the market
            </h3>

            <p>
                Comparing current price information with your
                planned budget can help you prepare before shopping.
            </p>

            <a href="#article2" class="read">
                Read article →
            </a>

        </article>

    </div>


    <!-- ARTICLE CONTENT -->

    <div class="info" id="article1">

        <h2>
            Why do fuel prices matter?
        </h2>

        <p>
            Fuel is used for transportation and the movement of
            goods. When fuel prices change, transportation and
            delivery expenses may also change. Consumers can
            monitor price updates and consider these changes
            when planning their household expenses.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="info" id="article2">

        <h2>
            Plan before you shop
        </h2>

        <p>
            Checking prices before going to the market can give
            consumers an idea of how much they may need to spend.
            A simple price reference can help households prepare
            their budget and make more informed purchasing decisions.
        </p>

    </div>

</main>


<footer>

    <p>
        PresyoCheck © 2026
    </p>

    <p>
        An academic prototype for community price information.
    </p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
